'convince someone that… 是让人相信某件事；convince someone of something 是使其确信某事；convince someone to do… 也常用于说服行动。','convince somebody that；convince somebody of；convince somebody to do。','persuade 常突出促成行动；convince 常突出改变看法，两者在实际用法中有重叠。',
